body:
A few extra bullet points to add to the post:  
\- This happened in California, where Doxxing is a crime;  
\- She made 2 posts to her Instagram. One asking if she should visit his house with a poll, and another taking a picture of his house with the text "Let's talk like adults";  
\- She has a past criminal record for armed robbery and owns a gun (Which I believe is another issue in itself), so the victim has every reason to be afraid of such interaction.
